  <item>
    <title>平面留学申请 | 从零基础DIY进耶鲁RISD</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6876a30b60f8f77d40b4f16d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6876a30b60f8f77d40b4f16d</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 16 Jul 2025 02:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【这是一期 Jo老师的单口，是由一期视频分享转为音频，请到微博小红书找到视频版来查看画面和字幕】</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>Jo Zixuan</span></p><span></span><p><span>设计师、插画师、老师</span></p><span></span><p><span>正在罗德岛设计学院（RISD）读平面设计研究生。本科毕业于纽约视觉艺术学院，做过四年的自由职业。</span></p><span></span><p><span>个人网站｜</span><a href="http://www.jozixuan.com/" data-url="http://www.jozixuan.com/"><span>www.jozixuan.com</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>小红书/微博｜@JoZixuan</span></p><span></span><p><span>研究生都快毕业了终于把申请的过程总结出来了！一条23年录完，拖了两年才发的经验分享！</span></p><span></span><p><span>三年前我暂停了插画工作，零基础自学平面设计申中了我想去的所有学校。最后决定痛拒耶鲁offer，去罗德岛读研。当时我详细记录了整个过程，累计了万字笔记作为以后的教学素材。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【 分享顺序 】</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>1. 为什么选择平面设计读研</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>2. 为什么 DIY 申请</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>3. 如何安排时间和自学计划</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>4. 作品集（下期）</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>5. 文书、面试、选校（下期）</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>【阅读清单】本期提到</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>Megg’s History of Graphic Design</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>Stop Stealing Sheep &amp; Find Out How Type Works by Erik Spiekermann</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>Thinking with Type by Ellen Lupton</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>Grid Systems in Graphic Design by Josef Müller-Brockmann**</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>如何创作字体 by 中信出版社</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>治字百方 by 左佐</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>Type Tricks by Sofie Beier（简单易懂的欧文入门好书）</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>Typography 字誌（脸谱出版）</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>Nicer Tuesday</span></li><span></span></ul>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/62862d55481e47f1ff4924e3/lqWZ2x4q3UWVQH0_BU-tETDLHv5V.m4a" length="33927705" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:34:57</itunes:duration>
